                 Oh no! Looks like there's a break in the chain!                
                                                                                
    This project uses Dolt proxied-server mode, which perles can't read yet.    
                                                                                
      Switch it to server mode (both modes keep their data in .beads/dolt):     
                                  bd dolt stop                                  
                    bd migrate from-proxied-server-to-server                    
                                                                                
        The migration is experimental in bd. It rewrites dolt_mode in the       
     committed .beads/metadata.json, so other clones switch when they pull.     
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                 Press q to quit                                
                                                                                
                                                                                